@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
hide circle
hide empty members
title C2 第 3 題：元素有 is-a，不代表群組有 is-a

interface SampleSource <<interface>> #F4F4F4
class HeavyRover #F4F4F4
class SampleTray #F4F4F4
class "SampleGroup<SampleSource>" as GS #FFE8D6
class "SampleGroup<HeavyRover>" as GH #DFF3E3
SampleSource <|.. HeavyRover : is-a（成立）
SampleSource <|.. SampleTray
GS -[#C0392B,dashed]- GH : <color:#C0392B>沒有 is-a（不成立）</color>
note bottom of GS
  假設允許 sources = cars：
  sources.add(new SampleTray(4)) 看起來合法，
  其實是塞進 cars（重型車群組）
  → 破壞 cars「只放重型車」的承諾，
  所以編譯器拒絕：incompatible types
end note
@enduml
